  "description": "The SCOTT Addict Gravel 20 is a pure gravel bike engineered for daily escapes off-road and light multi-day tours. Loaded with winning features from our top-tier model, it’s a featherweight design with rock‑solid stability and capacity to gear up for epic gravel.\n\nQuick, nimble, and instantly familiar handling is thanks to the HMF carbon frame, which blends balance, comfort, and off-road-specific design. Comfort and stability for the most rugged routes is unlocked with Addict Gravel’s massive tire clearance of up to 57mm.\n\nBeneath its sleek, internally routed silhouette lies a payload of off-road support. The downtube storage holds what you need, like tools and spares. In the bar ends, a handlebar tool tucks away out of sight, while the fork offers extra bottle‑cage mounts. Under the top tube, a dedicated insert accommodates a frame bag for hauling a bit more for dawn-to-dusk epics or a credit-card tour.\n\nPlease note that bike specifications are subject to change without prior notice.",
